<title>USA: Smartflex names Hohener CFO.</title>
<headline>Smartflex names Hohener CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smartflex Systems Inc said effective August 1, John Hohener will become chief financial officer, replacing Al Castleman, who will be moving toward a planned retirement.</p>
<p>Castleman will remain in his position at Smartflex until the end of July, at which time he will step down to part-time involvement.</p>
<p>Castleman joined Smartflex over three years ago to assist in taking it public, after serving as chief financial officer of several high-technology companies in the Silicon Valley.</p>
<p>Hohener is currently corporate controller and treasurer.</p>
</text>
